{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1542","id":4039540810,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87wxoBK","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1542","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1542.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1542.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1542","number":1542,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] add 9709 durable store and access ledger tooling","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nThis PR implements reusable local tooling for the 9709 ParentCreationGate durable artifact store and append-only access ledger. It is a tooling implementation only: it does not integrate with or activate the formal ParentCreationGate.\n\nThe durable store CLI validates owner authorization, rejects unsafe roots and symlink/path escapes, stores immutable content-addressed bytes, emits hash-bound `ArtifactStoreReceipt` records, performs readback/integrity/retention checks, builds inventories, and supports synthetic backup/restore rehearsal. Pytest temporary directories are available only through a dedicated Python test API; the formal CLI has no `--allow-tmp` escape.\n\nThe ledger CLI uses an exclusive file lock, atomic append, monotonic sequences, canonical JSON event hashes, and a previous-hash chain. Independent checkpoint receipts bind the event count, head hash, tail count, and full ledger hash so verification detects truncation, removal, reorder, mutation, duplicate sequence, broken links, partial final lines, forged or stale checkpoints, and uncheckpointed tails. Synthetic ACL probes emit deny events with qualification invalidation for the required role/resource cases, while explicitly stating that synthetic probes are not real filesystem ACL proof.\n\n## Scope and safety\n\n- Tooling implementation only.\n- No real durable root initialized; all test bytes are confined to pytest temporary directories and cleaned by pytest.\n- The real durable store blocker remains.\n- The real ACL/principal blocker remains.\n- Provider calls = 0.\n- Remote writes = 0.\n- Campaign A not started.\n- No system users, filesystem ACLs, E1 membership/commitment, existing ParentCreationGate manifest, core Gate implementation, frozen planning documents, or `package.json` were modified.\n- This PR does not emit `actual_campaign_principals_configured=true`, `append_only_access_log_verified=true`, or `durable_store_configured=true`.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `python scripts/vlm/validate_durable_artifact_store_contract_v1.py` — passed; formal gate remains false and all non-claims are preserved.\n- `pytest -q tests/vlm/test_durable_artifact_store_v1.py tests/vlm/test_append_only_access_ledger_v1.py` — 32 passed, including concurrent writers, immutable readback, media/hash/length conservation, authorization/root/symlink rejection, corruption, atomic-write/snapshot fault injection, chunked verification, partial-ledger-write recovery, backup/restore rehearsal, inventory/object/metadata mutation rejection, ledger tampering, checkpoints, deny events, qualification invalidation, secret scan, and no external store writes.\n- Existing active-issue-manifest checkout tests — 7 passed.\n- Existing ParentCreationGate contract builder and honest checkout NO-GO validator — passed with the five expected real blockers retained.\n- Existing parent-close contract tests — 8 passed; synthetic close fixture passed without emitting a formal close receipt.\n- JSON schemas/fixtures and workflow YAML parsing — passed.\n- `git diff --check` — passed.\n\nOne existing core Gate test on `origin/main@93525b3e5` still asserts that the formal bundle is missing even though PR #1539 added it (30 passed, 1 stale assertion failed). This PR intentionally does not modify that prohibited core Gate test; CI status is tracked separately below.\n\nGemini review: four relevant inline findings were addressed in `52ed63e8d`, replied to in-thread, and resolved. The dedicated `9709-durable-store-ledger-contract-tests` check and all non-core checks pass on that SHA; the only failing check is the pre-existing core Gate stale assertion described above.\n\nRestore integrity follow-up: `e16543ab2` verifies the inventory self-hash against embedded and independent backup receipts, enforces exact-set equality across inventory/object/metadata digests, binds paths to digest prefixes and filenames, and adds the reproduced delete-object/copy-metadata mutation test.\n","created_at":"2026-07-12T16:25:39Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T03:16:07Z","closed_at":"2026-07-13T03:16:07Z","merged_at":"2026-07-13T03:16:07Z","merge_commit_sha":"3f5c4bda86a17842ba9db8f1eca55c0afa68fea1","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1542/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1542/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/re